### 2. Introduction  

Skyline Realty Group, Inc., founded in 2005, is a leading real estate development and property management firm based in New York City. Over the years, we have established a strong reputation for delivering high-quality residential, commercial, and mixed-use properties. Our mission is to create sustainable communities through innovative development and effective management practices.

The purpose of this report is to provide detailed insights into our ongoing projects, leasing strategies, management approaches, and valuation processes. We aim to highlight our strategic partnerships, market positioning, and financial outlook.

